<script setup lang="ts">
import { onMounted, ref } from 'vue'
import { useRoute,useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { useAccount } from '../stores/account'
import { useOnboarding } from '../stores/onboarding'
import UiIcon from '../components/UiIcon.vue'
const account=useAccount(),guide=useOnboarding(),route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),error=ref('')
onMounted(async()=>{await account.refresh();if(!account.profile&&!account.error)void router.replace({path:'/login',query:{redirect:'/account'}})})
async function logout(){error.value='';try{await account.logout();await router.replace('/login')}catch(e){error.value=(e as Error).message}}
</script>
<template><main class="account-system-page"><header class="account-page-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">VIRIDEXA / MY FIELD NOTES</p><h1>我的研究空间</h1><p>账户身份与研究入口集中在这里。</p></div><span class="account-heading-mark" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="leaf" :size="34"/></span></header><p v-if="!account.ready">正在读取账户信息…</p><p v-if="account.error||error" class="auth-error" role="alert">{{account.error||error}} <button class="plain-button" @click="account.refresh">重试</button></p><template v-if="account.profile"><div class="account-heading"><div><p v-if="route.query.welcome==='1'" class="account-welcome" role="status">注册成功，欢迎加入植序。你的公众账户已登录。</p><h2>你好，{{account.profile.displayName}}</h2><p>下一份发现，从你想了解的问题开始。</p></div><button class="plain-button" :disabled="account.busy" @click="logout">退出登录</button></div><section class="account-identity" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><div class="account-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="user" :size="30"/></div><div><h2 id="identity-title">我的账户</h2><p>{{account.profile.email}}</p><span class="account-role">{{account.isAdmin?'管理员':'公众成员'}}</span><p class="auth-hint">邮箱验证尚未启用。账户身份不代表科研内容已获核验。</p></div></section><section class="account-start"><div><p class="section-kicker">START HERE</p><h2>第一次来？一起走一遍。</h2><p>从真实植物出发，认识图谱、实验台和研究助手。</p></div><button @click="guide.begin">开启新手引导 ↗</button></section><section class="account-links" aria-label="研究入口"><RouterLink to="/explore"><span><UiIcon name="leaf" :size="16"/> 01 / DISCOVER</span><h2>认识一株植物</h2><p>从中文名或学名进入公开目录。</p><b aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="arrow" :size="18"/></b></RouterLink><RouterLink to="/knowledge-graph"><span><UiIcon name="network" :size="16"/> 02 / CONNECT</span><h2>打开知识网络</h2><p>顺着真实关系，找到资料的来处。</p><b aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="arrow" :size="18"/></b></RouterLink><RouterLink to="/assistant"><span><UiIcon name="spark" :size="16"/> 03 / ASK</span><h2>提出研究问题</h2><p>读取真实工具结果与来源记录。</p><b aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="arrow" :size="18"/></b></RouterLink></section><RouterLink v-if="account.isAdmin" class="account-admin" to="/review">进入管理员审核台 →</RouterLink><p v-else class="account-boundary">你当前使用公众成员账户。候选审核、目录发布与来源许可管理仅向授权管理员开放。</p></template></main></template>
